    "detailed_description": "In Cavemen: The Rise of Tribe, you take on the role of a leader tasked with guiding your cavemen tribe to prosperity. Your main goal is to establish a stable supply chain to ensure your people do not starve nor freeze. You'll need to mine resources, hunt wild animals, and explore the map to discover new opportunities for your tribe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413370/extras/1a7b1e2b78c411a04ecb6cd30aa6cea7.poster.avif?t=1727609597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413370/extras/1a7b1e2b78c411a04ecb6cd30aa6cea7.webm?t=1727609597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413370/extras/1a7b1e2b78c411a04ecb6cd30aa6cea7.mp4?t=1727609597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you progress, you'll unlock new jobs and production options that allow you to create more advanced items and build better buildings. You can choose between different building materials for walls and roofs, allowing for a high level of customization as you build your tribe's homes and structures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413370/extras/732b05a526b983e07ac3b10ea2a77f4a.poster.avif?t=1727609597\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413370/extras/732b05a526b983e07ac3b10ea2a77f4a.webm?t=1727609597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413370/extras/732b05a526b983e07ac3b10ea2a77f4a.mp4?t=1727609597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With careful planning and resource management, your tribe will grow and flourish, with new members being born into the community. But be warned - as your tribe grows, so too will the challenges it faces. You will need to be prepared to face the increasing demand for food and drink, warmth and housing, medicine and other threats to your tribe's survival.<br><br>Will you be able to lead your tribe to prosperity and create a thriving civilization, or will your people freeze and starve under your leadership? The fate of your tribe is in your hands in Cavemen: The Rise of Tribe.",
